############ Delete API ############
####################################

### insert customer spammer
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers/_create/spammer
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "spammer",
    "register_at": "2024-03-04 00:00:00"
}

### delete customer spammer
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/customers/_doc/spammer